       <span class="subj">${esc(t.subject)}</span>
       <span class="who">${esc(t.user.name)} · ${esc(t.user.org)}</span></button>`).join("")
     + `<button class="item free" type="button" data-id=""><span class="subj">Вопрос о продукте</span>
       <span class="who">без тикета — только база знаний</span></button>`;
